- 纯客户端插件，**Host 半边是空的**，也没有构建步骤：`index.js` + `client.js` 直接就是可运行的 ESM。
- 渲染座位是 `shell.overlay`（整窗浮层）。DSH 的窗口框架没有「整窗顶部一行」的插槽，所以标签栏用固定定位贴在标题条下方，同时用一条 `:has()` 规则把框架顶下来 38px：

```css
  html[data-dsh-session-tabs="on"] div:has(> [data-shell-overlay]) {
    padding-top: calc(var(--dsh-windows-titlebar-height, 0px) + 38px) !important;
  }
  ```

- switch Sessions by **looking up and clicking**, no sidebar diving;
- if the sidebar gets in the way, **collapse it** — the tab bar stays;
- too many projects? **Fold** the ones you are not using into a small `name 3` chip and open it when needed.

1. Uninstall dsh-session-tabs in the plugin manager;
2. delete the leftover directory `C:\Users\<you>\.dsh\profiles\desktop\node_modules\dsh-session-tabs` (only that directory — your checkout is untouched);
3. install again from an Option A / A-2 URL; it takes about three seconds.

A machine that never had a local install does not hit this.

```css
  html[data-dsh-session-tabs="on"] div:has(> [data-shell-overlay]) {
    padding-top: calc(var(--dsh-windows-titlebar-height, 0px) + 38px) !important;
  }
  ```
